      "id": "b3b889ab-c44e-49e8-aee1-96837b90c04a",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-06-08T16:52:00.000Z",
      "title": "Mankind Pharma Limited Announces Management Changes, Effective June 8, 2026",
      "body": "Mankind Pharma Limited had approved a strategic realignment of its human resources leadership framework as part of an internal organizational restructuring exercise. Consequent to this internal restructuring, Mr. Nilesh Kulkarni was appointed as Head of Human Resource Functions of the Group and designated as Senior Management Personnel (SMP), effective June 8, 2026. Mr. Nilesh is a senior HR professional with over 25 years of experience, specializing in driving organizational transformation and high-performance cultures in the pharmaceutical sector. A proven track record in orchestrating multi-country M&A and integrations, L&D architecture, Talent management, Succession planning, and complex organization design for top global companies across India and international markets. He has held le",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
