      "date": "2026-06-01T11:06:27.000Z",
      "title": "MANKIND: Higher Future Multiple And Subsidiary Exit Will Support Further Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have raised their fair value estimate for Mankind Pharma from ₹2,515.74 to ₹2,653.40, citing updated assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E multiples. What's in the News Mankind Pharma has scheduled a board meeting on May 19, 2026, at 15:10 IST to consider standalone and consolidated audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026; review security cover for existing non convertible debentures after the redemption of ₹1,250 crore of NCDs on April 16, 2026; consider management changes; and evaluate an additional investment in its subsidiary, Mankind Medicare Private Limited (source: company board agenda).",
