      "title": "Analysts Have Made A Financial Statement On Mankind Pharma Limited's (NSE:MANKIND) Yearly Report",
      "body": "It's been a good week for Mankind Pharma Limited ( NSE:MANKIND ) shareholders, because the company has just released...",
